      "writtenOn": "2023-01-06T09:07:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Umm, this is hard to decide. But my thought is that it\u0027s not ok; changing the VM redirection looks similar to changing the debuggability (like the debug level change). Also, by not allowing such change, the implementation becomes much simpler and less buggy (e.g. your comment on VirtualMachine.java#803).\n\nWDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "c7870435_be6698a6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 377,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 383,
        "endChar": 56
